WEBVTT

00:37:29.413 --> 00:37:30.496
but one that we might not have

00:37:30.496 --> 00:37:34.704
and too many more years start editing its
own code while we're not paying attention.

00:37:35.288 --> 00:37:37.079
I think that's the kind
of thing that is worth

00:37:37.246 --> 00:37:41.079
a great deal of societal discussion about,
you know, just because we can do that.

00:37:41.079 --> 00:37:42.079
Should we?

00:37:42.788 --> 00:37:47.454
Yes, because one of the things that's
that's been most shocking to you about

00:37:47.454 --> 00:37:50.871
the last few years has been just the
power of unintended consequences.

00:37:51.329 --> 00:37:53.371
It's like you don't have to have

00:37:53.371 --> 00:37:57.163
a belief that there's some
sort of waking up of of

00:37:57.163 --> 00:38:01.038
an alien intelligence that suddenly
decided it wants to wreak havoc